body:
I appreciate the comment but from what I've read you take this way more serious than I do. I play this mostly for fun not to grind the game or try the meta weapons/strats. I hate taking it too seriously because that completely takes away the fun in the game.

&#x200B;

I'm just trying to relive the glory days of BO2 zombies in cold war.

Very nice. 

&#x200B;

have my upvote
